            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "In final version used the `vim.fn.col({ res.to.line, '$' })` instead of `reg.to.col = vim.fn.getline(reg.to.line):len()` to get `+1` of the last column. The reason is that this also includes a newline character which is arguably the intention of the `col=0` range in the first place.",
            "commit_id": "70bfee032a502718972846a635f6195f72ebeb2e",
